{"symbol":"PPARIVAH","yahoo":"PPARIVAH.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Paradeep Parivahan Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","website":"https://www.paradeepparivahan.com","about":"Paradeep Parivahan Limited provides cargo handling, port operation, imported cargo handling and transportation, and intra-port transportation services in India. The company operated through four segments: Trading of Other Items; Hiring of earth moving Equipment; Loading. Unloading & Rake handling; and Transportation. It offers in-plant shifting of bulk raw materials and hazardous cargo, railway siding operation, crusher operation, earth moving equipment and related services. The company also provides logistics, manpower supply, stevedore, port handling and heavy equipment, fabrication, dredging and reclamation, custom house clearing and forwarding agency, vessel husbandry, rake handling, and other shore agency services. In addition, it engages in the ready-mix concrete operation and trading of construction materials. The company was incorporated in 2000 and is based in Bhubaneswar, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:48:40+00:00","quote":{"price":299.0,"prevClose":296.65,"marketCap":339.07,"high52":306.0,"low52":125.0,"pe":14.18,"bookValue":103.29,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":23.06,"shares":1.134,"insiders":76.2,"institutions":1.18},"prices":{"dates":["2025-03-24","2025-03-25","2025-03-26","2025-03-27","2025-03-28","2025-04-01","2025-04-02","2025-04-03","2025-04-04","2025-04-07","2025-04-08","2025-04-09","2025-04-11","2025-04-15","2025-04-16","2025-04-17","2025-04-21","2025-04-22","2025-04-23","2025-04-24","2025-04-25","2025-04-28","2025-04-29","2025-04-30","2025-05-02","2025-05-05","2025-05-06","2025-05-07","2025-05-08","2025-05-09","2025-05-12","2025-05-13","2025-05-14","2025-05-15","2025-05-16","2025-05-19","2025-05-20","2025-05-21","2025-05-22","2025-05-23","2025-05-26","2025-05-27","2025-05-28","2025-05-29","2025-05-30","2025-06-02","2025-06-03","2